00:06:00,108 --> 00:06:02,272
beginning. Instead, it's waiting for input

147
00:06:02,272 --> 00:06:05,205
here whilst it's still executing the script.

148
00:06:05,718 --> 00:06:07,706
And that makes sense because that's exactly

149
00:06:07,706 --> 00:06:10,030
the code we wrote here. We're reading user

