00:06:49,831 --> 00:06:51,871
Now I can again type this is my message.

167
00:06:52,739 --> 00:06:55,005
If I now hit enter, we see user entered this

168
00:06:55,005 --> 00:06:55,760
is my message.

169
00:06:56,354 --> 00:06:59,219
So this is how we could read user input from

