00:07:18,967 --> 00:07:21,820
entire course, but I'm a big fan of teaching

180
00:07:22,189 --> 00:07:24,850
a topic thoroughly and making it very clear

181
00:07:25,058 --> 00:07:27,271
how it works under the hood so that if you

